<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15723" root="رضح" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رُضْحٌ</span></b>  is a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَضَحَ</span>; and [as such, as is
implied, or rather indicated, in the S,] signifies
<i>Broken</i> [or <i>bruised, brayed,</i> or <i>crushed,</i>] <i>datestones; i. q.</i> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوًى مَرْضُوحٌ</span></b> ; (S, K;) as also
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَضِيحٌ</span></b>  [i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَوًى رَضِيحٌ</span>]. (K.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَضِيخٌ</span>,
with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span>.]

